<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Reggies year share up.</title>
<headline>Reggies year share up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 19.8	  vs 11.2</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs   -</p>
<p>    Retained income	 15.65	 vs 7.70</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   23.69	 vs 11.62</p>
